<h2>The big picture</h2>
<p>Forest Churches is two applications plus a set of hosted services:</p>
<ul>
    <li><strong>ForestChurches</strong>: the website itself. An ASP.NET Core 8 Razor Pages app, packaged as a Docker image and run on <strong>Azure Container Apps</strong>.</li>
    <li><strong>EmailManagement</strong>: a small ASP.NET Core 8 Web API at <code>api.forestchurches.co.uk</code>, hosted on a <strong>Plesk</strong> server. The website never sends email itself; it hands every email to this app, which queues it and sends it through IONOS.</li>
</ul>

