            <tr><td><code>Events</code></td><td>Name, date, times, repeats, address, description, link, image (bytes and/or blob name), owner username, church name.</td><td>Linked to a church <strong>by church name</strong>, not by ID. Imported events use the ChurchSuite event ID as their own ID.</td></tr>
            <tr><td><code>WhitelistedUsers</code></td><td>Invitations: email, status (Pending/Completed), expiry, registration date.</td><td></td></tr>
