            <tr><td><code>bulletins</code></td><td>Bulletins, live flag, banner flag and expiry, PDF file name.</td><td>Created by the seeder if missing.</td></tr>
            <tr><td><code>applicationlogs</code></td><td>Serilog entries.</td><td>Created by the Serilog sink; never pruned.</td></tr>
            <tr><td><code>Hangfire*</code></td><td>Hangfire jobs, state, servers, recurring jobs.</td><td>Created by Hangfire.</td></tr>
