<h2>The EmailManagement app</h2>
<p>A separate, much smaller ASP.NET Core 8 Web API. It has one controller (<code>/Email</code>), two hosted services that trigger sending every 5 minutes, an in-memory queue and status store, and HTML templates in <code>./templates</code>. It doesn't use a database. Full details: <a asp-page="/Docs/Admin/Email">The EmailManagement app</a>.</p>
